    "⌘+F c'est le regroupement des développeurs Apple francophones. Retrouvez nous sur [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)." : {
      "comment" : "Foot of the catalog. ⌘+F is the collective's name; keep the Markdown link",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F هو ملتقى مطوّري Apple الناطقين بالفرنسية. تجدنا على [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F ist der Zusammenschluss französischsprachiger Apple-Entwickler. Du findest uns auf [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F brings together French-speaking Apple developers. Find us on [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F reúne a los desarrolladores Apple francófonos. Encuéntranos en [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F riunisce gli sviluppatori Apple francofoni. Ci trovi su [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+Fは、フランス語圏のAppleデベロッパが集まるコミュニティです。[cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)でお待ちしています。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F는 프랑스어권 Apple 개발자들의 모임입니다. [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)에서 만나 보십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F reúne os desenvolvedores Apple francófonos. Encontre-nos em [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⌘+F 是法语区 Apple 开发者的社群。欢迎访问 [cmdf.io](https://cmdf.io)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
